WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier, and welcome to The Final One.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:08.960
Now, this is supposedly an indie horror game that features terrifying, creepy dolls in some sort of fashion,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:17.260
which is always an A+ in my book and I'm eager to see what sort of sudo-mannequin-esq thing is going to be in this one.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.300
*story begins to unfold*

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.620
Woman: "Okay, from what you told, you think there is someone starting these troubles up."

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.280
"Right?"

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:23.760
Mark: Yee-

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:32.260
Man: "Yes, just like I told you. In the competitive world of business, we would use any method, in all means, to crush our rivals."

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.740
"No matter how much we get our hands dirty."

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:41.940
Woman: "I agree, but don't you think spreading rumors about haunted ghosts is a bit irrational?"

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.600
*long pause*

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.880
Mark: Noooo? Oh.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.040
"Yeah, I think it's silly too."

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.760
"However, it does cause a delay of the construction of my resort."

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.120
"The laborers ran away and it affects a lot of my plan."

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.240
Woman: "I understand."

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:03.320
Man: That's the reason why I want you to investigate and seek proof,

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:10.380
-because from my own opinion, I don't think those kind of rumors would really affect my employees."

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.360
Woman: "Do not worry. Maybe they are hiring your employee to do that."

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.000
Man: "OR, they were murdered."

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.500
Mark: *shocked* Wuh-

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:22.120
Woman: "Trust me, I'll do my best in the investigation-"

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.960
"-but I think it's a plan of your rivals."

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.620
Man: "I think of that, too."

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.620
"I'll leave it to you, then."

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.260
Mark: Whaa...?

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.500
Woman: "I give my word that I won't disappoint you."

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.200
Mark: Ohh.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:37.460
Man: "I believe in you. Haha, just don't get haunted by the ghost, then."

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.100
Woman (laughing): "Haha. sure."

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.720
Mark: Hahahahaha.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.240
What are the odds that that could happen in-

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:47.540
Woman: "So now, we're going to find out [Mark: Lil' Docka.] what's happening.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.920
"Inside the museum."

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:56.400
Ok. Alright. So, supposedly this business man hired this investigator to see if it's haunted with ghosts-

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:08.060
-but this business, or, uh, the investigator thinks that maybe it was just business rivals trying to do stuff. But, why would he not be able to know where his employees are?

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:14.580
How would he not know if they're murdered or not? Did they just run away without telling anybody? Did no one go here?

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.860
*door opens* Why am I here?

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:19.260
*steps* Why am I- okay. Here we go then.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:21.620
Okay.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:27.400
Oh, this looks good! Oh, yeah, I've seen great many museums that are haunted in my day.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.340
And this ranks up at the top. Oh. Hi.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.220
Hello. Oh, God, hi.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.740
Hello! Oh, I don't like you already!

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:39.900
Oh, I can already tell how much I hate you. Ohh, I am not going to have fun here.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:45.340
Alrighty then, let's see what's going on in this horrible museum. Like what kind of business is this?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.500
This is the worst museum ever!

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.160
Why would he have anybody working here?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.680
Why am I working here?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.200
Ohh, it's behind me, isn't it?

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.880
Okay, find the way to operate the elevator.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.020
I-I-I'm in it to win it. Hang on one second.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.820
I got to crank up the volume, so I can hear myself and everything that's going to kill me.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.480
Alright.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.160
*door opens* Hi! Hello!

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.820
Sorry to disturb you, go back to sleep!

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:17.080
Let me look at my objective before I find out what's going to kill me.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:24.760
Hel- oh, hi. Oh, mini dolls! Oh, you're probably just as lethal.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.460
Ooh. I thought something was behind me.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.740
Okay. There's a lot of you.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.540
