00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.780
Oh, hi.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:34.900
Eh.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.420
Ehhh.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.140
Ehhhh.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.060
Ehhgh.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.460
Alright.

