00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:24.980
Hi.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.300
Hello.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:29.340
Yeah, that's probably a good idea.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.100
Don't know why that required a cut scene, but okay!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.440
Let me save one more do-dadi time..

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.580
Let me guess, all the mannequins are gone now,

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:45.500
and I'm not going to- *glass shatters* Hello? Oh, you're still there!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.880
Ohhh, you're delightful, maybe.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:54.820
Ohh, hey! Ohh, I didn't notice the painting. The really disconcerting painting.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:58.080
