00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:02.740
Ok. You're still there. Let's play- hey! That's what this video is.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.660
Ok. Glad you know the subject matter.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.860
Ohhh, you're lovely.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.700
Oh, you're so lovely.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:11.500
Ehhh. (x2)

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.400
