00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.760
Alright, is there anything else over here?  Oh, okay, never mind then!

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.600
That plant was blocking my way.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.460
Guess I'll go to the elevator now.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.520
Goodbye, everybo-  *glass shatters* -body!  Hey, fuck you!

