00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.700
I just had the craziest flashback to Cry of Fear.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:48.880
Like, I legitimately had the craziest flashback to like, four years ago,

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.300
-when I was playing Cry of Fear, because I remember the cacophony of screaming children-

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:58.540
