Also, ow!

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:19.420
What- woah.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.120
That is SO Cry of Fear!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.740
Oh, hello. Okay.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.000
