00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:51.340
Eugh.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.840
I bet I didn't need to unload my entire clip from the gun, but-

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.420
-it felt like it was necessary in the moment.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:59.220
Find the power room's key.

