00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:06.040
*immense noise* EHH, fuck you!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.600
Fuck off, fuck off. Don't throw rocks at me!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.800
God, you boulder-hurling bastard. *more girl screeching*

