00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:45.860
Boap, boap, boap, beh, beh, beh, beh, okay, got you.

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:48.180
Alright, I can reload. I can waste one bullet.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:53.100
Better than being caught with my pants down when screamers are sprinting down my face.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.260
Okay! Alrighty, then.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.320
Ooh, is that a key?

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.860
Is that the key I need? Is that an employee?

