It won't open.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.000
Okay, then.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.240
I'll be on my way.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:09:59.860
Oh.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.000
Woman: "Mr. Wilhem? [Mark: Oh?] Are you alright?"

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.560
"Why are you here?"

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:08.420
Mr. Wilhem: "Ah. Ugh. I have been kidnapped for three days."

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.640
