00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:14.400
Mr. Wilhem: "That wasn't me. Ugh."

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.480
'i'm not going to make it."

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.760
*heavy breathing*

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:24.460
"But I have gathered all the evidence. It's in the office room, on the first floor."

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:31.100
"Ugh. You should go there and you will know the truth."

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:31.840
Mark: Oh, okay.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:34.440
Woman: "Mr. Wilhelm! Mr. Wilhelm!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.420
Mark: Uh, oh.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.720
Well, he survived three days.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:38.740
Woman: "I have to know what's happening here."

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.440
Mark: And then he died just in time to-

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:44.940
Woman: "It seems like I will have to go to the office room [Mark: Yeah. Yeah, it kinda seems like that] to get the answer."

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.380
Mark: He died just in time to give me a plot device.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.120
Well, sorry Mr. WIlhelm.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:53.620
Do you have any ammo that I could use? You still seem to be breathing.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:58.080
I don't think you're dead yet, but, you know, I am not going to help you.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:04.860
I'm just going to walk away and imagine all the other things I can do in my life while I'm not dead.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.780
Okay, goodbye!

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.840
Ding-dong, bing-bong.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:13.980
Okay? I guess I got to go to the office and discover the TRUTH, whatever the TRUTH may be.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.000
Whatever the TRUTH may hold.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:27.180
Also, sorry, like- if I'm a little lispy and spitty today, it's because yesterday we did a challenge where- that involved war heads and we melted off the entirety-

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:35.260
-of our mouth. So, it's- it's a- it's a little, a LITTLE uncomfortable to talk, and it just seems like I'm slightly inebriated.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:38.960
But, uh- trust me, I am not. I can't drink.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.180
I'll die.

